  "notes": [
    "Identity is providerAccountId, never the display name.",
    "Mapping does not authorize a canonical write.",
    "Leave DEBT&PAYMENTS and SAVINGS-DONT TOUCH unmapped. Do not give them atlasRole household-cash."
